function notificationDetailMatches(notification,detail){if(!notification||!detail)return false;const clean=value=>String(value||'').normalize('NFKC').toLocaleLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim().replace(/[.!?]+$/,'');const message=clean(notification.message),change=clean(detail);if(!message||!change)return false;if(message===change||message.endsWith(' · '+change)||message.endsWith(': '+change))return true;const separator=message.indexOf(' · ');return separator>=0&&message.slice(separator+3)===change;}
window.notificationContextMarkup=notificationContextMarkup;window.notificationDetailMatches=notificationDetailMatches;
function renderNotifications(){const list=$('#notificationList');if(!list)return;const unread=Number(state.notificationUnreadCount)||0;$('#notificationBadge').textContent=unread>99?'99+':String(unread);$('#notificationBadge').hidden=unread===0;$('#notificationBell').setAttribute('aria-label',`Notifications, ${unread} unread`);$('#notificationUnreadLabel').textContent=`${unread} unread`;$('#notificationMarkAll').disabled=unread===0;const notifications=state.notifications.filter(item=>state.notificationFilter!=='unread'||!item.readAt);if(!notifications.length){list.innerHTML=`<div class="notification-empty"><strong>${state.notificationFilter==='unread'?'You’re all caught up':'No notifications yet'}</strong>${state.notificationFilter==='unread'?'There are no unread updates.':'Updates connected to your work will appear here.'}</div>`;return;}const iconFor=kind=>({task:'✓',calendar:'▦',intake:'◎',development:'✦',document:'▤'})[kind]||'•';list.innerHTML=notifications.map(item=>`<button type="button" class="notification-item${item.readAt?' is-read':''}" data-notification-id="${escapeHtml(item.id)}"><span class="notification-kind-icon kind-${escapeHtml(item.kind)}" aria-hidden="true">${iconFor(item.kind)}</span><span class="notification-copy"><strong>${escapeHtml(item.title)}</strong><span>${escapeHtml(item.message)}</span><small>${item.actorName?`${escapeHtml(item.actorName)} · `:''}${notificationTime(item.createdAt)}</small></span><span class="notification-unread-dot" aria-label="Unread"></span></button>`).join('');}
